{
  "id": "jump-game",
  "order": 38,
  "title": "Jump Game",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "pattern": "Greedy",
  "statement": "You start at index 0 of `nums`; `nums[i]` is the maximum jump length from index `i`. Return `true` if you can reach the last index.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= nums.length <= 10^4",
    "0 <= nums[i] <= 10^5"
  ],
  "function": {
    "name": "canJump",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "nums",
        "type": "int[]"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "bool"
  },
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(n)",
    "space": "O(1)"
  },
  "hints": [
    "Do you need to know the exact path, or only how far you can get?",
    "Track the furthest index reachable so far. When do you get stuck?",
    "Scan left to right; if i > reach return false; otherwise reach = max(reach, i + nums[i])."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        [
          2,
          3,
          1,
          1,
          4
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "0 -> 1 -> 4."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          3,
          2,
          1,
          0,
          4
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "Every path gets stuck at index 3."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0,
          1
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          2,
          0,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          1,
          0,
          1
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          1,
          3,
          1,
          0,
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0,
          0,
          1,
          0,
          0,
          1,
          0,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          2,
          1,
          0,
          2,
          2,
          3,
          1,
          1
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          3,
          0,
          0,
          3
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0,
          2,
          2,
          1
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
